        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 2430-601, 11-5/8 Auxiliary Spring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 11-5/8\" long auxiliary spring is for use on gates up to 50 pounds for self closing. Adjustable tension allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the gate (how hard/fast the door self closes). Includes adjustment tool. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Bommer-2430-size.gif?v=1704442292\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer 2430 Gate Spring Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIncludes (4) #12 x 1-1/4\" round head wood screws for installation. This economical gate closing device is non-handed.  Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Bommer 2430-601 11-5/8 Auxiliary Spring\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Length: 9-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish Color: Bright Black</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: 50 Lbs. Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Wrought Steel Heads</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2430.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 2430 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
